# Source: Ventrax AV4 report. Acceptance specification; execution is verified separately.
Feature: Installation and device management

  Scenario: Register a property for the account holder
    Given an authenticated primary user has a valid account
    When the user submits valid property details
    Then Installation associates the new property with that account

  Scenario: Reject a property belonging to another account
    Given the user owns property A and not property B
    When the user requests property B
    Then Installation rejects access without exposing property B

  Scenario: Register a supply point in an authorized property
    Given the primary user owns an active property
    When the user registers a valid supply point
    Then Installation links the point to the authorized property

  Scenario: Restrict installer management to SuperAdmin
    Given an authenticated primary user does not have SuperAdmin role
    When the user requests installer administration
    Then Installation denies the operation

  Scenario: Assign an available installer automatically
    Given a confirmed installation request and an eligible available installer
    When the assignment policy runs
    Then Installation records the assigned installer and the updated request state

  Scenario: Reject a duplicate device identifier
    Given a device identifier is already registered
    When SuperAdmin registers another device with the same identifier
    Then Installation rejects the duplicate device

  Scenario: Complete installation only with a valid associated device
    Given the installation is in progress
    And its device is associated with the correct supply point
    And device provisioning has been confirmed
    When SuperAdmin completes the installation
    Then Installation records the completion once

  Scenario: Deny access to a meter with a revoked grant
    Given a subuser has a revoked permission for meter A
    When the subuser requests that operation on meter A
    Then Installation rejects access without altering permissions for other meters
